{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mass.QHookDimension","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mass.QHookDimension","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Ring.Finset","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Order.BigOperators.Group.Finset","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Field.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Field.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.FieldSimp","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.NormNum"],"declarations":43,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.selection_rule_c3_real","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.selection_rule_c3_real","kind":"theorem","line":292,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L292-L300","doc":"**The c=3 anchor over `ℝ_{>0}`, with nothing assumed.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.selection_rule_c3_from_hooks","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.selection_rule_c3_from_hooks","kind":"theorem","line":275,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L275-L290","doc":"**c = 3 anchor, derived.**  `(1/4) Σ_{λ⊢4} dim_q V_λ = 5/2 + (3/4)h²`, over\nthe real q-dimensions of the five partitions of 4. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.dimQ_two_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.dimQ_two_two","kind":"theorem","line":268,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L268-L273","doc":"**`dim_q V_{(2,2)} = [4]_q/[2]_q = q² + q⁻²`** — the one H₄ dimension that is\nnot `1` or `[3]_q`, and the reason the c=3 anchor has a `3/4 h²` in it. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.dimQ_two_one_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.dimQ_two_one_one","kind":"theorem","line":263,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L263-L266","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.dimQ_three_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.dimQ_three_one","kind":"theorem","line":258,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L258-L261","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.dimQ_one_four","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.dimQ_one_four","kind":"theorem","line":253,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L253-L256","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.dimQ_four","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.dimQ_four","kind":"theorem","line":248,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L248-L251","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.qInt_four_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.qInt_four_eq","kind":"theorem","line":240,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L240-L246","doc":"`[4]_q = (q² + q⁻²)·[2]_q`.  Stated as a product rather than the quotient\n`[4]/[2]` so it needs no non-vanishing hypothesis of its own. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.qFact_four","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.qFact_four","kind":"theorem","line":237,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L237-L238","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.hooks_one_four","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.hooks_one_four","kind":"theorem","line":235,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L235-L235","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.hooks_two_one_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.hooks_two_one_one","kind":"theorem","line":234,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L234-L234","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.hooks_two_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.hooks_two_two","kind":"theorem","line":233,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L233-L233","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.hooks_three_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.hooks_three_one","kind":"theorem","line":232,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L232-L232","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.hooks_four","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.hooks_four","kind":"theorem","line":231,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L231-L231","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.selection_rule_c1_real","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.selection_rule_c1_real","kind":"theorem","line":218,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L218-L222","doc":"**The c=1 anchor over `ℝ_{>0}`, with nothing assumed.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.selection_rule_c2_real","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.selection_rule_c2_real","kind":"theorem","line":207,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L207-L216","doc":"**The c=2 prediction over `ℝ_{>0}`, with nothing assumed.**  This is the\nstatement `prop:selection-rule-c2-prediction` describes: the q-dimensions are\nthose of the partitions of 3, computed from their hook lengths, and the closed\nform follows. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.qInt_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.qInt_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":203,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L203-L205","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.qInt_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.qInt_pos","kind":"theorem","line":199,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L199-L201","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.selection_rule_c2_from_hooks","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.selection_rule_c2_from_hooks","kind":"theorem","line":181,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L181-L190","doc":"**c = 2 prediction, derived.**  `(1/3) Σ_{λ⊢3} dim_q V_λ = (q+1)²/(3q)`,\nwith the three q-dimensions computed from their hook multisets. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.selection_rule_c1_from_hooks","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.selection_rule_c1_from_hooks","kind":"theorem","line":172,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L172-L179","doc":"**c = 1 anchor, derived.**  `(1/2) Σ_{λ⊢2} dim_q V_λ = 1`, over the real\nq-dimensions rather than over the literal `1`s. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.dimQ_two_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.dimQ_two_one","kind":"theorem","line":158,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L158-L164","doc":"**`dim_q V_{(2,1)} = [2]_q`** — the one non-trivial H₃ dimension, and the\nvalue the c=2 selection rule turns on.  Hooks `[3,1,1]` against `[3]_q!`:\nthe `[3]` cancels and the `[1]`s are 1, leaving `[2]_q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.dimQ_one_one_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.dimQ_one_one_one","kind":"theorem","line":153,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L153-L156","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.dimQ_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.dimQ_three","kind":"theorem","line":148,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L148-L151","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.dimQ_one_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.dimQ_one_one","kind":"theorem","line":144,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L144-L146","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.dimQ_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.dimQ_two","kind":"theorem","line":140,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L140-L142","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.qFact_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.qFact_three","kind":"theorem","line":137,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L137-L138","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.qFact_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.qFact_two","kind":"theorem","line":134,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L134-L135","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.qFact_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.qFact_one","kind":"theorem","line":131,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L131-L132","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.hooks_one_one_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.hooks_one_one_one","kind":"theorem","line":118,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L118-L118","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.hooks_two_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.hooks_two_one","kind":"theorem","line":117,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L117-L117","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.hooks_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.hooks_three","kind":"theorem","line":116,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L116-L116","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.hooks_one_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.hooks_one_one","kind":"theorem","line":115,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L115-L115","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.hooks_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.hooks_two","kind":"theorem","line":114,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L114-L114","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.dimQ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.dimQ","kind":"def","line":105,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L105-L107","doc":"**The q-hook-length formula.**  `dim_q V_λ = [n]_q! / ∏_{cells} [hook]_q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.hooks","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.hooks","kind":"def","line":100,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L100-L103","doc":"Every hook length of the diagram, row by row. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.hookAt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.hookAt","kind":"def","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L96-L98","doc":"Hook length at cell `(i, j)`: arm + leg + 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.conjugate","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.conjugate","kind":"def","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L91-L94","doc":"The conjugate (transpose) of a partition given as a weakly-decreasing list of\nrow lengths: column `j` of `λ` is as long as there are rows exceeding `j`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.qFact","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.qFact","kind":"def","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L86-L89","doc":"q-factorial `[n]_q! = ∏_{k=1}^{n} [k]_q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.qInt_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.qInt_three","kind":"theorem","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L80-L84","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.qInt_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.qInt_two","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L74-L78","doc":"No `q ≠ 0` needed: at `q = 0` both sides are `0`, since Lean sends `0⁻¹`\nto `0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.qInt_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.qInt_one","kind":"theorem","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L72-L72","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.qInt_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.qInt_zero","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L70-L70","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.qInt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.qInt","kind":"def","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QHookDimension.lean#L63-L68","doc":"Balanced q-integer `[n]_q = q^{-(n-1)} + q^{-(n-3)} + ⋯ + q^{n-1}`.\n\nWritten as a sum of `zpow`s rather than as `(qⁿ − q⁻ⁿ)/(q − q⁻¹)` so that it is\ntotal: no `q ≠ ±1` hypothesis is needed anywhere downstream. ","signatureChunk":0}]}